#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, cbPriority)
#. +> trunk stable
#: rc.cpp:41
msgid "Check this option if you want to run the application with a different priority. A higher priority tells the operating system to give more processing time to your application."
msgstr "Wenn Du dat Programm mit en anner Prioriteet utföhren wullt, muttst Du disse Optschoon anmaken. Mit en höger Prioriteet deelt dat Systeem dat Programm mehr Perzessertiet to."

#. i18n: file: shellOptions.ui:224
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, cbPriority)
#. +> trunk stable
#: rc.cpp:44
msgid "Run with a &different priority"
msgstr "Mit &anner Prioriteet lopen laten"

